	<main>

	<section class="hero alt-hero">
		<div class="hero-badge">Comparison · Self-Hosted Email</div>
		<h1>Mailu <span>vs</span> Stalwart</h1>
		<p class="alt-lead">
			Two ways to self-host email, built on different foundations. Mailu
			packages Postfix, Dovecot and Rspamd as a small Docker Compose stack with webmail,
			an admin UI and a REST API, set up through a web wizard. Stalwart rewrites every
